1
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did those cops know</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

2
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:15,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng's diamonds</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>were in this house?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

3
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's what I'm saying.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

4
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:20,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There must be a mole among us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I know who it is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

6
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:25,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who do you mean?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

7
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:29,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The guy who just started working</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>for Kamnan Sawaeng.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

8
00:00:48,320 --> 00:00:49,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

9
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh no!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

10
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:25,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chan! Where are you taking the diamonds?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

11
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:39,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

12
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:31,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hand over the diamonds, Chan.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

13
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:33,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Otherwise, I'll kill you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

14
00:03:33,160 --> 00:03:34,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Move it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

15
00:06:24,400 --> 00:06:26,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Everyone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

16
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:30,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>People often worry more</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>about others' words</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

17
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>than the truth within themselves.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

18
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Good or bad</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

19
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:41,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is not judged by others' words,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

20
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:44,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but by our own actions.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

21
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If our actions are good,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

22
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:52,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then even if the whole world</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>calls us evil,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

23
00:06:52,160 --> 00:06:54,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we are still good.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

24
00:06:57,280 --> 00:06:59,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But if our actions are wrong,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

25
00:06:59,760 --> 00:07:03,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then even if others praise us,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

26
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we are still in the wrong.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

27
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:08,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we do good</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

28
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:13,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and others slander us as evil,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

29
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>do not lose heart.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

30
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:18,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Keep doing good.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

31
00:07:19,640 --> 00:07:22,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I believe that one day,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

32
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>our good deeds</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

33
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:28,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>will speak for themselves.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

34
00:07:29,280 --> 00:07:31,800
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Sadhu.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

35
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:35,320
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>-Sadhu.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>-Sadhu.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

36
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:49,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>why do monks have to collect alms?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

37
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:52,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If no one gives them food,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

38
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:54,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>won't they go hungry</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and isn't that terrible?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

39
00:07:55,560 --> 00:07:56,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, child.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

40
00:07:57,640 --> 00:07:58,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Even if I explain it now,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

41
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:01,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you wouldn't understand.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

42
00:08:01,080 --> 00:08:03,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait until you're older.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

43
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:06,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I suppose</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you won't grow any older now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

44
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:08,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come now. You'll understand someday.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

45
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:18,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho! A ghost!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

46
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-A ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-There's a ghost over there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

47
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:23,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-The ghost is over there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

48
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:26,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How do you know it's a ghost?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

49
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:28,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you afraid of ghosts?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

50
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:30,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You are a ghost too. Why are you scared?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

51
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go see if he really is one.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

52
00:08:40,600 --> 00:08:41,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who could this be?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

53
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:56,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

54
00:08:59,400 --> 00:09:00,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

55
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:18,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It has been two days,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and he still hasn't woken up.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

56
00:09:31,880 --> 00:09:33,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's awake!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

57
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Mister…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

58
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:56,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho. Where…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

59
00:09:58,480 --> 00:09:59,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where am I?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

60
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Am I dead?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

61
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:08,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Not yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

62
00:10:08,200 --> 00:10:11,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're still in the same world as before.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

63
00:10:14,960 --> 00:10:16,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

64
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:19,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did I get here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

65
00:10:20,280 --> 00:10:24,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I found you unconscious by the stream.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

66
00:10:24,440 --> 00:10:26,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The current must have carried you there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

67
00:10:27,480 --> 00:10:29,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By the stream?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

68
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:30,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did I get there?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

69
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:34,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you don't know, how would I know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

70
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:40,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And my name is…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

71
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's my name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

72
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:49,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't even</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

73
00:10:49,920 --> 00:10:52,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>remember your own name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

74
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

75
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I really can't remember</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

76
00:10:57,320 --> 00:10:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who I am</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

77
00:10:58,320 --> 00:10:59,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or what I'm doing here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

78
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:02,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why is my head injured?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

79
00:11:02,080 --> 00:11:03,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch. I'm so confused.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

80
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

81
00:11:05,440 --> 00:11:08,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Calm down. Take your time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

82
00:11:08,320 --> 00:11:10,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It will come back to you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

83
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:14,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I remember that before I woke up,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

84
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:17,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I dreamed I was a celestial being.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

85
00:11:17,280 --> 00:11:21,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But then I stole from a celestial maiden,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and they kicked me out of heaven.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

86
00:11:21,880 --> 00:11:23,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It was so high.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

87
00:11:23,640 --> 00:11:24,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, wow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

88
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:29,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You fell from the sky?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

89
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:31,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

90
00:11:32,080 --> 00:11:34,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you remember…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

91
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:39,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what you stole for them</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to kick you out of heaven?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

92
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:41,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can't remember.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

93
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What did I steal from them?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

94
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's all right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

95
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tomorrow,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

96
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:51,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we'll go into town.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

97
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Maybe something there</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

98
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:54,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>will help you remember.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

99
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:57,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>For now, get some rest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

100
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:01,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

101
00:12:02,920 --> 00:12:03,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Man…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

102
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

103
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I told you not to run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

104
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:28,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't run!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

105
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:32,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You owe us money and refuse to pay?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

106
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:35,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-No! Don't hurt my husband!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Take this! Still refusing to pay?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

107
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:39,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Don't! Help! Get away!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Take that!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

108
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:43,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please give me a few days.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't have it now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

109
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:44,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I want it today,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

110
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:46,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with interest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

111
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:48,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Or I'll beat your husband to death.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

112
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:50,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No! Don't hurt him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

113
00:12:51,440 --> 00:12:53,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You want to take his place, don't you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

114
00:12:54,920 --> 00:12:56,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Take this!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-No!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

115
00:12:58,640 --> 00:12:59,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Get up! Let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

116
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:01,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who the hell are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

117
00:13:02,440 --> 00:13:04,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You don't need to know who I am.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

118
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:06,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What were you two doing?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

119
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Bullying someone defenseless?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

120
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:10,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stay out of it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

121
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is local business.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

122
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:14,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I happen to be human too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

123
00:13:14,280 --> 00:13:16,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I hate seeing people get bullied,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

124
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:18,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>especially those who can't fight back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

125
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:21,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I work for Kamnan Sawaeng.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you know who he is?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

126
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:22,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sawaeng who?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

127
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

128
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's not my father's name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

129
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:28,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You talk like that? You want a beating?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

130
00:13:34,360 --> 00:13:35,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

131
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Damn it. Are you really a woman?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

132
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:51,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

133
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:54,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Want to check? Want another round, huh?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

134
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Want to see?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

135
00:14:13,840 --> 00:14:15,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is the Pink Star diamond,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

136
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:17,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>worth 300 million, that was stolen.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

137
00:14:20,720 --> 00:14:22,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I've heard the news.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

138
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ms. Yok,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

139
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:26,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>owner of five-star hotels across Asia.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

140
00:14:27,040 --> 00:14:30,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes. Ms. Yok had this diamond</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>insured with CIS,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

141
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:32,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a world-class insurance company.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

142
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>More importantly,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

143
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:38,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>she has claimed the full value</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of the stolen item.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

144
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:41,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But the insurance company</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>still has concerns,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

145
00:14:41,160 --> 00:14:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>especially about Ms. Yok's statement.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

146
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Her statement was inconsistent,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

147
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:47,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so they want us to look into it urgently.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

148
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have any information</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>on the culprit yet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

149
00:14:51,840 --> 00:14:53,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Our source says</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

150
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:56,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the Central Police are certain</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the diamond theft was carried out</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

151
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>by Kamnan Sawaeng's men.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

152
00:14:58,800 --> 00:15:02,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's a powerful figure in the north</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and an avid diamond collector.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

153
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:05,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He also has plenty</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of skilled gunmen working for him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

154
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:09,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Recently, they raided</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>his mountain residence,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

155
00:15:10,040 --> 00:15:12,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but his men opened fire.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

156
00:15:13,040 --> 00:15:14,680
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>They fled with the diamond.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

157
00:15:47,880 --> 00:15:49,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Take this!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

158
00:15:59,680 --> 00:16:02,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Several days have passed,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but there's still no sign of them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

159
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:03,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>As for Kamnan Sawaeng,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

160
00:16:03,880 --> 00:16:06,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>he claims it had nothing to do</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>with him or his men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

161
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:07,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and knows nothing about any diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

162
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:13,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The police obtained CCTV footage</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>from a bank in town</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

163
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>showing the getaway car</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

164
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:18,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>stopping at an ATM before vanishing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

165
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:21,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These are the faces</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of two of the four suspects.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

166
00:16:28,080 --> 00:16:31,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BANGKOK</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

167
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:07,359
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is Police Captain Chansuek,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a skilled undercover agent we sent to work</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

168
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:10,599
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>as one of Kamnan Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in Mae Hong Son some time ago.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

169
00:17:11,200 --> 00:17:14,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain Chansuek sent a message</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>confirming that Kamnan Sawaeng</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

170
00:17:14,839 --> 00:17:17,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>hid Ms. Yok's diamond</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in a house on a hillside.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

171
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:20,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So I sent in a covert team,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

172
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:21,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>but something went wrong.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

173
00:17:21,800 --> 00:17:24,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The suspects got wind of it, opened fire,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

174
00:17:24,880 --> 00:17:26,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and escaped with the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

175
00:17:27,040 --> 00:17:30,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Later, the getaway car</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>was found overturned in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

176
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:34,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Two of Kamnan Sawaeng's men</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>were found dead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

177
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:40,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The two missing from the scene</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>were Captain Chansuek and Sakon.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

178
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:43,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They disappeared along with the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

179
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:46,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If Captain Chansuek had the diamond,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

180
00:17:46,640 --> 00:17:48,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>he would have returned with it by now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

181
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:53,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Or maybe he betrayed us</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and stole the diamond for himself.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

182
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:57,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you know him well enough to say that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

183
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:03,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I trust Captain Chansuek.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

184
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:05,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He would never do such a thing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

185
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:06,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

186
00:18:06,680 --> 00:18:08,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>something must have happened to him.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

187
00:18:09,200 --> 00:18:10,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain Kan,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

188
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:12,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Lieutenant Ae, and Sergeant Lerm,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

189
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:14,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>head to the area today.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

190
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:16,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But go in quietly.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

191
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:19,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tell the local station</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

192
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:23,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>not to let this leak to anyone,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>especially the press,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

193
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:26,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>until I can contact Captain Chansuek.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

194
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:27,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

195
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:51,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh no!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

196
00:18:53,360 --> 00:18:54,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ghost!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

197
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:56,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

198
00:18:57,080 --> 00:18:58,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What's wrong?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-A ghost, Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

199
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, I'm scared!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

200
00:19:00,880 --> 00:19:03,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't come so close to me. Stay back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

201
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:07,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-No, I'm scared.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Stay away from me! I'm a monk!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

202
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:08,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you so scared of?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

203
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ghosts, of course!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

204
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:14,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What ghost? Go away! Sleep over there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-No!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

205
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm scared of ghosts.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

206
00:19:17,200 --> 00:19:18,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tofu.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

207
00:19:19,600 --> 00:19:20,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tofu?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

208
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:23,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's this late,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and you still want to eat tofu?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

209
00:19:23,280 --> 00:19:24,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's sleep, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

210
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:26,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please let me sleep here near you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

211
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let me sleep here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

212
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:11,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Freeze! Don't move!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

213
00:20:17,360 --> 00:20:18,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Freeze!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

214
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:19,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is this about?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

215
00:20:20,000 --> 00:20:20,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Put the gun down.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

216
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:13,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

217
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This gun and this money aren't mine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

218
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:19,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did they end up here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

219
00:21:24,280 --> 00:21:26,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sergeant Padej, you're under arrest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

220
00:21:27,480 --> 00:21:28,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Take him into custody.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

221
00:21:46,960 --> 00:21:50,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So this is who you really are, Captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

222
00:22:09,680 --> 00:22:11,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We've come all this way</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

223
00:22:11,560 --> 00:22:13,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and you still don't remember anything?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

224
00:22:14,360 --> 00:22:15,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

225
00:22:16,480 --> 00:22:19,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Seriously, do you not remember</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

226
00:22:20,760 --> 00:22:22,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>what mission brought you into this forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

227
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:25,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Please, I really can't remember.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

228
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:29,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why would I be</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>on a mission in this forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

229
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:30,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

230
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:33,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you talk as if you know me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

231
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:41,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And do you think you remember me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

232
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:47,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

233
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:49,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I really don't remember.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

234
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:52,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

235
00:22:52,480 --> 00:22:53,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

236
00:22:53,720 --> 00:22:55,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>my head hurts.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

237
00:22:56,280 --> 00:22:57,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Ouch!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

238
00:22:58,440 --> 00:22:59,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right, then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

239
00:23:00,800 --> 00:23:02,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Since you remember nothing,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

240
00:23:03,040 --> 00:23:06,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I believe we should leave</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>this forest first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

241
00:23:06,400 --> 00:23:09,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>By now, people outside</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>must be searching everywhere for you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

242
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:12,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's hurry.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We still have a long way to go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

243
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:17,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What did you pack in here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's really heavy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

244
00:23:27,520 --> 00:23:28,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

245
00:23:29,520 --> 00:23:31,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>aren't we out of the forest yet?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

246
00:23:32,840 --> 00:23:36,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Probably in two days.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

247
00:23:36,600 --> 00:23:38,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? Two days?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

248
00:23:40,800 --> 00:23:45,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If we want to get there faster,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we can go without resting.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

249
00:23:45,080 --> 00:23:47,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It should take about</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

250
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:50,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>one night and half a day.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

251
00:23:51,640 --> 00:23:54,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you living so deep in the forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

252
00:23:54,160 --> 00:23:55,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Isn't it difficult?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

253
00:23:57,000 --> 00:24:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If I wish to endure hardship,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I must go on a forest pilgrimage.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

254
00:24:01,680 --> 00:24:03,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>To seek inner peace.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

255
00:24:05,320 --> 00:24:06,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>From now on, Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

256
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:09,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>please don't call me "layperson."</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

257
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:11,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It feels too distant.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

258
00:24:15,680 --> 00:24:17,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then what should I call you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

259
00:24:18,400 --> 00:24:19,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

260
00:24:20,560 --> 00:24:22,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then please give me a name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

261
00:24:23,040 --> 00:24:25,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Something auspicious. Any name is fine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

262
00:24:25,840 --> 00:24:27,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just think of me as your disciple.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

263
00:24:29,200 --> 00:24:33,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll name him Tofu Pudding.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He'll be my junior disciple. How's that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

264
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

265
00:24:42,000 --> 00:24:44,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll give you a name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

266
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll call you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

267
00:24:47,000 --> 00:24:48,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

268
00:24:49,600 --> 00:24:50,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

269
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come on, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

270
00:24:53,720 --> 00:24:56,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That sounds like</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>an orphan's name from a movie.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

271
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is there a better name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

272
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:01,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Anything other than Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

273
00:25:01,640 --> 00:25:02,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Never mind, then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

274
00:25:02,600 --> 00:25:04,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hold on, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

275
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:08,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I still don't know your name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

276
00:25:09,080 --> 00:25:11,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What should I call you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

277
00:25:18,920 --> 00:25:20,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My name is…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

278
00:25:28,920 --> 00:25:29,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tiger?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

279
00:25:30,800 --> 00:25:32,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You know my name too?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

280
00:25:33,640 --> 00:25:35,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

281
00:25:35,760 --> 00:25:36,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tiger!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

282
00:25:37,600 --> 00:25:39,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How do you know my name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

283
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:42,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How could I not know? It's walking</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>right toward us! I'm out of here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

284
00:25:42,240 --> 00:25:43,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm out of here!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

285
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tiger!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

286
00:26:39,360 --> 00:26:40,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You and I</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

287
00:26:41,520 --> 00:26:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>both fled the heat to seek shade.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

288
00:26:44,080 --> 00:26:45,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But I…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

289
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>have walked into your territory.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

290
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:52,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let us not harm one another.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

291
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You go your way, and I'll go mine.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

292
00:26:55,240 --> 00:26:57,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let us not create bad karma between us.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

293
00:26:58,240 --> 00:27:02,720
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Sabbe satta,</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>all beings who are fellow sufferers</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

294
00:27:02,800 --> 00:27:06,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of birth, aging, sickness, and death.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

295
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:09,640
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Avyapajjha hontu,</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

296
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:13,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>be happy and free from harm.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

297
00:27:14,320 --> 00:27:19,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>May they not harm one another.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

298
00:27:33,480 --> 00:27:35,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

299
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:38,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

300
00:27:44,280 --> 00:27:45,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

301
00:27:46,080 --> 00:27:47,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you all right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

302
00:27:53,160 --> 00:27:54,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Did you drive the tiger away?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

303
00:27:55,880 --> 00:27:56,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

304
00:27:58,200 --> 00:28:00,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Your spiritual powers are that strong?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

305
00:28:03,520 --> 00:28:06,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right, I'll take that name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

306
00:28:06,280 --> 00:28:07,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod it is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

307
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:09,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll be Boonrod until the day I die.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

308
00:28:10,440 --> 00:28:11,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Excellent.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

309
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:12,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

310
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:14,560
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Sadhu.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

311
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:18,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're incredible!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

312
00:28:19,360 --> 00:28:21,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You really ran for your life, didn't you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

313
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I had to survive.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

314
00:28:24,920 --> 00:28:25,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

315
00:28:27,440 --> 00:28:29,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're no ordinary monk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

316
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:44,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The car was parked around here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>two days ago.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

317
00:28:45,840 --> 00:28:49,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The villagers said two bodies were found.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

318
00:28:50,360 --> 00:28:51,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Two people died?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

319
00:28:51,840 --> 00:28:53,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

320
00:28:53,360 --> 00:28:54,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It wasn't reported in the news at all.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

321
00:28:54,880 --> 00:28:56,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They didn't let anyone near the scene.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

322
00:28:56,760 --> 00:28:59,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The police cleared</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>the wreckage away in no time.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

323
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:04,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They cleared everything away.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

324
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And covered it up too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

325
00:29:06,680 --> 00:29:07,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

326
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:09,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

327
00:29:09,800 --> 00:29:11,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Chatree, Kamnan Sawaeng's son.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

328
00:29:15,120 --> 00:29:16,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Kamnan Sawaeng's son?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

329
00:29:16,480 --> 00:29:17,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

330
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:21,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

331
00:29:21,200 --> 00:29:23,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These people are scary.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll wait in the car.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

332
00:29:41,120 --> 00:29:42,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They have guns?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

333
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:46,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go search around.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>See if you find anything else.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

334
00:29:47,760 --> 00:29:49,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Is the diamond</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>really that expensive, boss?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

335
00:29:49,360 --> 00:29:52,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You couldn't afford it</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in a hundred lifetimes, you idiot.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

336
00:29:52,600 --> 00:29:56,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My dad has already found a buyer</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>willing to pay over 400 million!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

337
00:29:56,560 --> 00:29:57,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

338
00:30:01,080 --> 00:30:05,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you find anyone suspicious, or anyone</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>who knows anything about the diamond,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

339
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:06,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>bring them to me first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

340
00:30:07,320 --> 00:30:10,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'll make them suffer first,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>then ask about the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

341
00:30:12,480 --> 00:30:14,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey! Who's there?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

342
00:30:18,360 --> 00:30:21,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Go after them!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Let's go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

343
00:30:37,080 --> 00:30:38,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Actually,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

344
00:30:38,680 --> 00:30:40,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>your face does seem familiar.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

345
00:30:41,720 --> 00:30:46,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>After countless lifetimes, people are</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>bound to cross paths now and then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

346
00:30:46,120 --> 00:30:48,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, talk of past lives</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

347
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:51,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>really suits you as a monk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

348
00:30:51,360 --> 00:30:53,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How long have you been a monk?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

349
00:30:53,080 --> 00:30:56,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A little over five years.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

350
00:30:56,440 --> 00:30:59,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why did you become a monk, then?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No wife or kids?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

351
00:31:00,360 --> 00:31:02,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why do you want to know?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

352
00:31:02,360 --> 00:31:05,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Will it bring your memory back?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

353
00:31:06,320 --> 00:31:07,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you scolding me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

354
00:31:15,480 --> 00:31:16,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop right there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

355
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:22,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Gunshots.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

356
00:31:23,840 --> 00:31:25,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who would be shooting out here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

357
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:27,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It must be thunder.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

358
00:31:31,520 --> 00:31:33,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Come on, now!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

359
00:31:41,120 --> 00:31:42,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Let's go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

360
00:32:00,760 --> 00:32:02,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-This way!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Okay.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

361
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:06,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where did she go?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

362
00:32:12,440 --> 00:32:14,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Jeez! Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

363
00:32:15,600 --> 00:32:17,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's wrong?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

364
00:32:17,120 --> 00:32:19,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I need to…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

365
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:21,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I need to pee.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

366
00:32:21,720 --> 00:32:23,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Oh no.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

367
00:32:25,040 --> 00:32:26,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can't you hold it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

368
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:30,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right, go then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

369
00:32:31,480 --> 00:32:33,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But before you do anything,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

370
00:32:33,880 --> 00:32:36,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>ask the guardian spirits</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>for permission first.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

371
00:32:36,680 --> 00:32:39,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-There are many forest spirits here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

372
00:32:40,360 --> 00:32:41,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're scaring me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

373
00:32:41,960 --> 00:32:43,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm scared of ghosts as it is.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

374
00:32:44,080 --> 00:32:46,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If one shows up,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I would rather it be a fairy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

375
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:49,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hurry up and go.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

376
00:32:49,960 --> 00:32:51,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then I'll go now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

377
00:32:51,520 --> 00:32:53,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm going. I can't hold it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

378
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:55,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I can't!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

379
00:33:03,400 --> 00:33:05,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So? Whose men are they?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

380
00:33:06,720 --> 00:33:07,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No sign of them, boss.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

381
00:33:07,880 --> 00:33:10,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You fools! Completely useless!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

382
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:12,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I only caught</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a glimpse of her from behind.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

383
00:33:12,600 --> 00:33:16,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It was a woman,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>probably gathering things in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

384
00:33:16,760 --> 00:33:19,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You can't even catch some hill woman?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

385
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:21,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Should I feel relieved?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

386
00:33:22,680 --> 00:33:23,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Gosh.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

387
00:33:25,240 --> 00:33:27,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go! What the hell are you waiting for?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

388
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:49,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Hey! A ghost!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What? I'm no ghost.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

389
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:52,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's this wet stuff?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

390
00:33:53,200 --> 00:33:57,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Not my fault. I was peeing.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why did you come here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

391
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You jerk!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

392
00:34:08,040 --> 00:34:10,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>These are the faces</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>of two of the four suspects.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

393
00:34:14,440 --> 00:34:15,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

394
00:34:16,639 --> 00:34:18,679
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? What's wrong with you, auntie?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

395
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:20,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who are you calling "auntie"?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

396
00:34:20,520 --> 00:34:22,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You, auntie.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

397
00:34:22,120 --> 00:34:23,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm not even thirty yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

398
00:34:23,960 --> 00:34:25,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Watch your mouth.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Wait, wait.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

399
00:34:25,960 --> 00:34:27,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Before we talk about age…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

400
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:28,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Auntie…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

401
00:34:28,920 --> 00:34:30,679
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I mean, where did you come from?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

402
00:34:33,239 --> 00:34:34,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I ran away.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

403
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:35,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you a thief?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

404
00:34:35,840 --> 00:34:37,239
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're the one who's a thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

405
00:34:37,840 --> 00:34:39,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What did I steal?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You're the thief!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

406
00:34:40,440 --> 00:34:43,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Steal what?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What's going on, Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

407
00:34:48,600 --> 00:34:49,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who's this now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

408
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

409
00:34:53,199 --> 00:34:54,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Greetings, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

410
00:34:55,600 --> 00:34:57,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Pay respects to the Buddha.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

411
00:35:00,200 --> 00:35:01,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

412
00:35:01,680 --> 00:35:03,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You really are a monk, right?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

413
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:08,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Why are you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-That's rude.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

414
00:35:09,800 --> 00:35:11,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're getting out of line.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

415
00:35:12,800 --> 00:35:14,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Now she thinks you're a fake monk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

416
00:35:16,760 --> 00:35:19,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What kind of fake monk would be out here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

417
00:35:19,400 --> 00:35:21,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You can hear me?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

418
00:35:25,960 --> 00:35:26,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

419
00:35:27,600 --> 00:35:29,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I am a wandering monk.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

420
00:35:30,600 --> 00:35:32,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And… what about you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

421
00:35:32,840 --> 00:35:34,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What are you running from?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

422
00:35:36,440 --> 00:35:37,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

423
00:35:38,360 --> 00:35:42,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, could I explain later?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was running away from bandits.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

424
00:35:42,520 --> 00:35:43,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Can we talk somewhere else?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

425
00:35:47,320 --> 00:35:50,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All right. Come with me, then.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

426
00:35:54,200 --> 00:35:55,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I asked for a fairy,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

427
00:35:56,040 --> 00:35:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and they sent me an auntie here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

428
00:35:58,840 --> 00:35:59,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why are you here?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

429
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:03,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-You peed on me, and you still say that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Luang Pho, wait for me!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

430
00:36:03,240 --> 00:36:05,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Gross!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

431
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

432
00:36:09,200 --> 00:36:10,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Who were you running from?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

433
00:36:12,040 --> 00:36:13,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

434
00:36:13,960 --> 00:36:16,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't know them either.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

435
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:20,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>They probably thought I saw something</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I shouldn't have.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

436
00:36:21,800 --> 00:36:22,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

437
00:36:22,840 --> 00:36:23,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Serves you right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

438
00:36:24,680 --> 00:36:27,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Always poking your nose</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>into other people's business.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

439
00:36:28,040 --> 00:36:29,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Just say I'm nosy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

440
00:36:29,280 --> 00:36:31,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Smart one, aren't you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

441
00:36:31,200 --> 00:36:32,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, I'm not nosy, okay?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

442
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:38,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I really like these two, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

443
00:36:44,880 --> 00:36:46,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Layperson…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

444
00:36:46,840 --> 00:36:49,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't mind my disciple.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

445
00:36:49,280 --> 00:36:51,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>He's a little crazy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

446
00:36:53,000 --> 00:36:54,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

447
00:36:54,520 --> 00:36:56,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you're not on my side at all.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

448
00:36:56,480 --> 00:36:59,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't think he's crazy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

449
00:36:59,120 --> 00:37:01,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I would call it a personality flaw.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-A personality flaw?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

450
00:37:02,560 --> 00:37:06,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If you mean bad character, just say it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Stop trying to sound so refined.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

451
00:37:07,840 --> 00:37:10,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>From the way you look,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

452
00:37:10,880 --> 00:37:12,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>you're not from around here, are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

453
00:37:13,160 --> 00:37:14,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

454
00:37:14,160 --> 00:37:15,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

455
00:37:15,640 --> 00:37:17,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What brings you this deep into the forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

456
00:37:19,200 --> 00:37:21,680
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Why would the diamond thief</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>be with a monk?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

457
00:37:21,760 --> 00:37:23,880
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Is he even a real monk?</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

458
00:37:24,480 --> 00:37:26,120
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>I had better not trust either of them.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

459
00:37:29,720 --> 00:37:32,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-I know why, Luang Pho.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

460
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:35,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Because you stole something from them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

461
00:37:35,600 --> 00:37:36,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>She's a thief.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

462
00:37:37,360 --> 00:37:39,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, I came here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to photograph butterflies.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

463
00:37:39,880 --> 00:37:40,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

464
00:37:41,960 --> 00:37:43,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Photographing butterflies?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

465
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:45,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Wow, you must be really free.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

466
00:37:45,840 --> 00:37:47,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where's your camera, then?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

467
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:49,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't see one.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

468
00:37:50,320 --> 00:37:51,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where is it?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

469
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:53,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, right.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

470
00:37:53,080 --> 00:37:55,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-My camera!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Stop right there!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

471
00:38:01,480 --> 00:38:05,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I must have dropped my camera</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>while running away.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

472
00:38:06,760 --> 00:38:08,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What a shame.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

473
00:38:09,040 --> 00:38:10,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I had so much proof on that camera.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

474
00:38:14,160 --> 00:38:19,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I mean proof of how many</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>butterfly species exist in the world.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

475
00:38:20,600 --> 00:38:22,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm an entomologist.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

476
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:28,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's why I came here to study insects</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in the northern forest region.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

477
00:38:30,000 --> 00:38:31,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Really?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

478
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:33,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Your camera is gone.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

479
00:38:33,960 --> 00:38:35,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What about your other belongings?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

480
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:37,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't tell me your other things</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>are gone too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

481
00:38:37,760 --> 00:38:39,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How did you come into the forest</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>empty-handed?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

482
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:41,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Nothing else at all?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

483
00:38:42,000 --> 00:38:44,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You sound like a cop, bro.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

484
00:38:47,560 --> 00:38:49,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My bag?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

485
00:38:49,240 --> 00:38:50,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I left it in the rental car.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

486
00:38:51,600 --> 00:38:53,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All my stuff was in there.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

487
00:38:54,680 --> 00:38:55,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh no.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

488
00:38:56,680 --> 00:38:57,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Darn it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

489
00:39:02,840 --> 00:39:05,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

490
00:39:05,080 --> 00:39:07,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

491
00:39:11,000 --> 00:39:12,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>A storm was coming that day.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

492
00:39:12,720 --> 00:39:14,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>If it had rained,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

493
00:39:14,720 --> 00:39:16,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>our evidence would've been ruined.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

494
00:39:17,840 --> 00:39:20,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The crime scene was a complete mess,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

495
00:39:21,400 --> 00:39:23,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>so I told my men to clear it up.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

496
00:39:23,880 --> 00:39:24,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What's so strange about that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

497
00:39:26,520 --> 00:39:28,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then why the rush to cremate both bodies?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

498
00:39:28,760 --> 00:39:29,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Nothing had been proven yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

499
00:39:32,160 --> 00:39:34,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Their families requested it.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

500
00:39:34,560 --> 00:39:36,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And the bodies were badly damaged.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

501
00:39:38,760 --> 00:39:39,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>But--</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

502
00:39:43,040 --> 00:39:43,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey, kid.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

503
00:39:44,560 --> 00:39:46,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I don't work for you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

504
00:39:46,160 --> 00:39:47,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm the superintendent.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

505
00:39:48,440 --> 00:39:50,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're just a captain.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

506
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My apologies, sir.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

507
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:58,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I was just wondering…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

508
00:40:00,040 --> 00:40:01,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>why you didn't follow procedure.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

509
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:11,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You've got it wrong.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

510
00:40:12,160 --> 00:40:13,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This is my turf.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

511
00:40:14,120 --> 00:40:15,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I do things my way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

512
00:40:15,920 --> 00:40:21,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You Bangkok cops</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>only know what's in the books.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

513
00:40:22,320 --> 00:40:23,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you ever been out in the field?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

514
00:40:24,400 --> 00:40:26,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Don't act like you know better</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>than the locals.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

515
00:40:28,040 --> 00:40:31,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then I'd like to request backup</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

516
00:40:31,640 --> 00:40:33,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to search for the suspect in the forest.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

517
00:40:40,520 --> 00:40:41,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Where are the documents?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

518
00:40:42,040 --> 00:40:43,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Do you have a formal request letter?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

519
00:40:43,840 --> 00:40:45,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You show up here in secret.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What do you expect me to do?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

520
00:40:45,880 --> 00:40:48,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>This station is very busy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

521
00:40:48,640 --> 00:40:50,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No one here has time to help.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

522
00:40:51,320 --> 00:40:52,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How many of you came?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

523
00:40:57,680 --> 00:40:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Three of you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

524
00:41:00,080 --> 00:41:00,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That should be enough.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

525
00:41:09,880 --> 00:41:10,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

526
00:41:11,920 --> 00:41:13,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The rental car is gone?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

527
00:41:20,640 --> 00:41:23,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No signal either. What now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

528
00:41:25,120 --> 00:41:28,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All my clothes and makeup…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

529
00:41:28,760 --> 00:41:32,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>All my stuff was in that car!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How am I going to get home now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

530
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:35,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Aren't we going into town?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

531
00:41:35,840 --> 00:41:37,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think we should wait for a car here.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

532
00:41:38,120 --> 00:41:41,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No chance.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The driver said nobody comes this way.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

533
00:41:41,480 --> 00:41:42,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's full of robbers too.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

534
00:41:42,840 --> 00:41:45,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I paid him so much,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and he didn't even wait for me.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

535
00:41:47,840 --> 00:41:50,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So what do we do now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

536
00:41:50,600 --> 00:41:52,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It's getting dark.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

537
00:41:55,080 --> 00:41:59,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>And those men chasing you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>might still be nearby.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

538
00:41:59,800 --> 00:42:01,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>How about this?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

539
00:42:01,600 --> 00:42:05,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Come with us for now.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

540
00:42:05,640 --> 00:42:09,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>There might be villagers ahead.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We can ask them for help.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

541
00:42:18,760 --> 00:42:21,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I think Superintendent Cheewin</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>is acting strange.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

542
00:42:23,680 --> 00:42:26,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then who can we ask for help?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

543
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:30,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Then we'll work together</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>and investigate it ourselves.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

544
00:42:41,160 --> 00:42:42,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Dad.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

545
00:42:42,680 --> 00:42:46,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I just saw someone</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>snooping around the crash site.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

546
00:42:46,080 --> 00:42:48,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>When we called out,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>whoever it was ran away.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

547
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:50,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>It could be connected</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to the diamond thieves.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

548
00:42:51,720 --> 00:42:55,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Superintendent Cheewin sent word</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

549
00:42:55,800 --> 00:42:58,480
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>that Deputy Commander Papon,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>a high-ranking officer from Bangkok,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

550
00:42:58,560 --> 00:43:01,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>has sent his own team here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>to search for the diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

551
00:43:04,280 --> 00:43:05,200
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Son,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

552
00:43:05,920 --> 00:43:09,120
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>find those two before they get to them.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

553
00:43:09,200 --> 00:43:11,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Otherwise, we won't get the diamond back.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

554
00:43:12,400 --> 00:43:13,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Yes, Dad.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

555
00:43:43,360 --> 00:43:47,400
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>This guy is far too goofy</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>to be a diamond thief.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

556
00:43:47,480 --> 00:43:51,040
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>But then again,</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>anyone could be a diamond thief.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

557
00:43:51,120 --> 00:43:54,880
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>I had better find out more,</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>then slip away once we reach a village.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

558
00:43:57,000 --> 00:43:58,720
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey. Can we…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

559
00:44:00,000 --> 00:44:01,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What now?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

560
00:44:02,640 --> 00:44:06,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No. I just want to get to know you better.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

561
00:44:08,120 --> 00:44:10,400
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why bother? You'll be gone soon.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

562
00:44:12,040 --> 00:44:13,800
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're not very friendly, are you?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

563
00:44:16,800 --> 00:44:17,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

564
00:44:18,480 --> 00:44:19,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My name is Noona.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

565
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:23,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

566
00:44:23,160 --> 00:44:25,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What? Boonrod?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

567
00:44:27,600 --> 00:44:29,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's really your name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

568
00:44:29,680 --> 00:44:30,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The nerve…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

569
00:44:30,920 --> 00:44:32,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Why argue with the owner of the name?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

570
00:44:33,000 --> 00:44:34,000
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

571
00:44:34,680 --> 00:44:37,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You just don't look like someone</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>named Boonrod.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

572
00:44:38,560 --> 00:44:42,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Boonrod sounds like an old man's name.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

573
00:44:42,760 --> 00:44:43,840
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Man…</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

574
00:44:43,920 --> 00:44:45,560
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>My name is my business.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

575
00:44:46,080 --> 00:44:49,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>You're human,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>yet your name means "field mouse."</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

576
00:44:54,320 --> 00:44:58,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So what are you doing out here</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>in the forest?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

577
00:44:58,400 --> 00:45:02,440
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Well, Luang Pho just said</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>we came on a forest pilgrimage.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

578
00:45:02,520 --> 00:45:04,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, I mean you.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

579
00:45:04,160 --> 00:45:07,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Luang Pho's disciple.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

580
00:45:07,880 --> 00:45:09,320
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>This guy is pretty good at lying.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

581
00:45:10,680 --> 00:45:15,600
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>He acts so well. I can't read him at all.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

582
00:45:17,040 --> 00:45:20,400
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>A real professional.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>No wonder he managed to steal the diamond.</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

583
00:45:23,560 --> 00:45:26,160
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>That's not what I mean.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

584
00:45:26,240 --> 00:45:30,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Have you been with Luang Pho all along,</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>or did you just join him?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

585
00:45:31,240 --> 00:45:34,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Luang Pho taught me that the past is past.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

586
00:45:35,120 --> 00:45:37,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We should live in the present.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

587
00:45:37,360 --> 00:45:40,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>So I live in the present.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

588
00:45:40,680 --> 00:45:42,960
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Luang Pho's disciple. End of story.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

589
00:45:43,480 --> 00:45:44,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Sleepy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

590
00:45:44,840 --> 00:45:45,680
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Drowsy.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

591
00:45:45,760 --> 00:45:47,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Tired.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

592
00:45:47,160 --> 00:45:48,280
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>The end.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

593
00:45:49,640 --> 00:45:50,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

594
00:45:50,720 --> 00:45:52,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Wait a second.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>-Jeez.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

595
00:45:53,760 --> 00:45:55,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>We haven't cleared this up yet.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

596
00:47:07,840 --> 00:47:09,600
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, found it!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

597
00:47:12,000 --> 00:47:12,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Oh, come on!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

598
00:47:13,720 --> 00:47:14,760
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hard-boiled egg.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

599
00:47:58,800 --> 00:47:59,920
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>No, don't!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

600
00:48:00,560 --> 00:48:02,200
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>No, don't!</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

601
00:48:04,840 --> 00:48:07,440
<c.white><c.bg_transparent><i>Daddy, Mommy, help me!</i></c.bg_transparent></c.white>

602
00:49:03,080 --> 00:49:05,880
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I'm Boonrod, not Chan.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

603
00:49:05,960 --> 00:49:07,360
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>NEXT EPISODE</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

604
00:49:09,960 --> 00:49:12,040
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>I would like to ask you</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>about the missing diamond.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

605
00:49:12,120 --> 00:49:15,320
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>What do you mean by asking me that?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

606
00:49:18,920 --> 00:49:20,520
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Go, go!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

607
00:49:25,640 --> 00:49:26,640
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Are you a police informant?</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

608
00:49:31,240 --> 00:49:32,080
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Hey!</c.white></c.bg_transparent>

609
00:51:54,240 --> 00:51:59,240
<c.bg_transparent><c.white>Subtitle translation by: Akekaphong C.</c.white></c.bg_transparent>
